<title>USA: Oakhurst names director Davies as chairman.</title>
<headline>Oakhurst names director Davies as chairman.</headline>
<dateline>GRAND PRAIRIE, Texas 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oakhurst Co Inc said Friday that its board had elected Robert Davies as chairman and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>The company said Mark Auerbach, who has been chairman and CEO since December 1995, will continue to serve on the board.</p>
